<title>JAPAN: Yamato Setubi - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Yamato Setubi - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 20, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 15.82		vs	   17.24</p>
